            <div xml:id="d218">

                <pb facs="0311" n="195" xml:id="pg195"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File, No. 839.51/1180.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to Minister Sullivan.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-01-07T20:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 7, 1914, 8 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Insular Bureau of War Department will tonight telegraph Receivership to advance
                    to Minister of Finance $20,000 account Government’s portion January customs.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moore</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
